# Git LFS is NOT used: the owning account's LFS budget is exhausted (verified 2026-10-11).
# Binaries are committed as regular objects and kept small (compressed .blend, optimized GLB);
# every binary is reproducible from scripts/ via build/build_all.sh.
*.blend   binary
*.glb     binary
*.exr     binary
*.ogg     binary
*.wav     binary
*.gd      text eol=lf
*.py      text eol=lf
*.sh      text eol=lf
*.tscn    text eol=lf
*.tres    text eol=lf
